  "question": {
    "text": "If <math><mi>A</mi></math> is an invertible square matrix of the order <math><mi>n</mi></math> such that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>≠</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mi></mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mi></mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></msup></math>, then the sum of all possible values of <math><mi>n</mi></math> is&nbsp;",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "L2ecX",
      "text": "<math><mn>3</mn></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "mwWV5",
      "text": "<math><mn>4</mn></math>",
      "image": null,
