      "id": "1vi8v",
      "text": "<math><mn>5</mn></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>We know that <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mi></mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>j</mi><mi></mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></msup></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfenced></msup></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Hence, the sum of all values of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math>&nbsp;is equal to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn></math></p>",
